{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Man vs. Machine", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Famous Robots", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Explain about technology and technical problems in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Subject and Object Relative Clauses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>When you want to clarify which person or thing you are talking about, you use a relative clause.</p><p>You can begin a relative clause with <span class=\"italic\">who</span> for people, <span class=\"italic\">which</span> for things or <span class=\"italic\">that</span> for either people or things.</p><p>In spoken English you usually use <span class=\"italic\">that</span>, rather than <span class=\"italic\">which</span> or <span class=\"italic\">who</span>.</p><p>You put the relative clause immediately after the noun it talks about.</p>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "A subject relative clause describes the subject of the clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Example:</span><br/><span class=\"italic\">The man <span class=\"strong\">who/that</span> called wanted to speak to Tom.</span><br/>Which man? The man who called.<br/>The clause <span class=\"italic\">who called</span> immediately follows man - the noun it describes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "An object relative clause describes the object of the clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Example:<br/></span><span class=\"italic\">The book <span class=\"strong\">which/that</span> I lent you was my father's.</span><br/>Which book? The book I lent you.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Relative Connector</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Type of Relative Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">WALL-E was the robotic unit who fell in love.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"who fell in love\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"who\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It was \u2018The Jetsons' robot Rosie, who rolled around on casters.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"who rolled around on casters\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"who\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">WALL-E was a robotic unit which scientists designed to clean up Earth.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"which scientists designed to clean up Earth\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"which\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"object\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Robots will enjoy the same rights that humans enjoy.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that humans enjoy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"object\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About Wishes and Imaginary Situations", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>You use<span class=\"italic\"> wish</span> to talk about things you do not have/do or cannot have/do.</p><p>You use the second conditional to talk about situations that are possible, but not likely.</p>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Wish form:<br/>Wish + that-clause (you can leave \u201cthat\u201d out)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Second conditional form:<br/>If + past simple, modal (could, would, should, might)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example Sentence</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I had a new car.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I want a new car but I don't have a new car.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He wished he could go with us.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He wants to go but he cannot go.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If she were taller, she could be a model.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She is not taller so she cannot be a model.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If I won a lot of money, I would travel.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I haven't won a lot of money so I am not traveling.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "What would the world be like if robots enjoyed the same rights that humans enjoy?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If we ventured into the future, how would robots integrate into our lives?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "What famous robot do you wish you could invite into your life?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mechanical", "type": "name"}, {"content": "operated by machine", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Mechanical workers were created by a wealthy industrialist.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about famous robots.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "industrialist", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an owner in a high position in industry", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The industrialist wanted robots to work in his factory.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to revolt", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to take action against authority", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The robots in the factory revolted.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "benevolent", "type": "name"}, {"content": "kind; helpful", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Some robots on film were benevolent. Others were destructive.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to pose", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to ask", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He posed an interesting question.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "oversized", "type": "name"}, {"content": "larger than usual", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Forbidden Planet showed an oversized robot as part of the exploration team.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le05ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to prompt", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make something happen", 